                "10 + Spell Level + Intelligence Modifier"
              ],
              "question": "In D&D 5e SRD, what is the exact formula for a character's Spell Save DC?"
            },
            {
              "answer": "6.0 seconds with visual round progress timer",
              "options": [
                "1.0 second real-time tick",
                "Variable based on Agility stat",
                "6.0 seconds with visual round progress timer",
                "10.0 seconds turn-based phase"
              ],
              "question": "How long is a standard D&D 5e combat round in the tactical RTwP engine?"
            },
