              "caption": "Lab 5.2: Generating the Godot 4 project and running godot4 --headless --import to update .godot/imported/*.ctex.",
              "title": "Run `python3 /home/ndipiazza/Downloads/ff1/build_ff1_godot_game.py` and `godot4 --headless --path /home/ndipiazza/Downloads/ff1/ff1-game --import`"
