              "code": "jq '{scene_shown, hero_position, gold: .game_state.gold, party: [.game_state.party[] | {name, class, hp, str, atk, eva}]}' \\\n  /home/ndipiazza/Downloads/ff1/ff1-game/tests/e2e/reports/gamestate_start_a_new_game_from_title_screen_create_4_light_warriors_and_enter_coneria.json",
              "expected": "The JSON snapshot shows `scene_shown.name: \"Coneria\"`, `hero_position: {\"x\": 16, \"y\": 18, \"facing\": \"up\"}`, `gold: 400`, and all 4 Light Warriors (`ZEST`, `SAIL`, `ROBO`, `MAGE`) initialized with their exact NES Level 1 stats.",
              "image": "/assets/elearning/jrpg-kgraph/labs/lab-m5-s3-http-control-bridge.png",
              "imageAlt": "JSON payload returned by GET /api/v1/state on port 8090 showing scene_shown, hero_position, and party stats",
