              "code": "sed -n '60,115p' /home/ndipiazza/Downloads/ff1/ff1-game/tests/e2e/features/steps/ff1_steps.py",
              "expected": "You will see how `post_input(\"ui_accept\")`, `post_input(\"move_up\")`, and `post_command(\"load_scene\", ...)` communicate with `http://127.0.0.1:8090` and poll `get_state()` until transitions complete.",
              "image": "/assets/elearning/jrpg-kgraph/labs/lab-m5-s4-scene-transition-state.png",
              "imageAlt": "HTTP POST /api/v1/input and /api/v1/command requests driving Godot 4 scene transitions",
