                "GL Compatibility allows higher polygon count 3D models",
                "Vulkan does not support 2D sprite rendering in Godot 4",
                "It enables Ray Tracing and DLSS by default"
              ],
              "question": "Why does RobOS cRPG Realm use the Godot 4 GL Compatibility renderer rather than Vulkan Forward+?"
            },
            {
              "answer": "Fails direct raycast line-of-sight and routes through safe corridor waypoints via A* visibility graph",
              "options": [
