          "title": "Module 2: Godot 4.3 Engine Runtime & 2.5D Isometric Architecture"
        },
        {
          "durationMinutes": 10,
          "id": "mod-03-assets-and-hud",
          "labSteps": [
            "Inspect Flare RPG animated 8-directional spritesheets in games/crpg-realm/assets/sprites/",
            "Examine games/crpg-realm/scripts/HUD.gd for 3-mode activity log sizing (Small 124px, Medium 240px, Large 420px)",
            "Verify in-log numbered dialogue option selection (keys 1-9 or click) without intrusive popup modals"
          ],
          "overview": "Explore CC-BY-SA 3.0 asset harvesting from Flare RPG (100+ animated 8-directional creatures and modular paperdoll gear), Game-Icons.net vector icons, and an authentic Infinity Engine HUD replica: Spacebar RTwP pause, Shift-click waypoint queuing, circle selection rings, and 3-mode expandable Activity Log with in-log dialogue.",
          "quiz": [
