            "Inspect `~/Downloads/ff1/nes_data/spells.json` to verify spell `power` (`effectivity`), `accuracy`, and the NES bug notes on `LOCK`, `LOK2`, and `TMPR`",
            "Run `update_reference_guide.py` and re-run `jrpg-parser.js parse` to verify the enriched 1,206-node Knowledge Graph"
          ],
