              "expected": "All 12 NES-quantized class sprites (`class-sprite-fighter.png` through `class-sprite-black-wizard.png`) and 5 battle backdrops are present in `assets/generated/`, and `publish` exports a clean graph with zero verbatim guide quotes.",
              "image": "/assets/elearning/jrpg-kgraph/labs/lab-m5-s1-clean-room-art-sheet.png",
