            "Extract the title and final frames of Scenario 1 (`start_a_new_game_...mp4`) with `ffmpeg` and verify the hero stands on the brick street at `(16, 18)`",
            "Inspect Scenario 2 (`speak_to_coneria_townsfolk_and_the_king_of_coneria_in_the_throne_room.mp4`) and its `gamestate_*.json` report",
            "Extract frame `0.5s` and the final battle frame of Scenario 3 (`open_a_treasure_chest_...mp4`) to verify the silver-and-brown NES chests at `(2, 3)` and `(3, 3)` and Garland’s defeat"
          ],
